@host = http://localhost:5080
### Create short URL
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"https://example.com","expiresInDays":30}

### Start agent workflow
POST {{host}}/api/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{"requirement":"Create a short URL service with analytics","scenario":"greenfield","simulateTestFailure":true}

### Metrics
GET {{host}}/api/workflows/metrics
